    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789830/extras/0471c8dad1e2908d8dab645e0db811a5.avif?t=1749968532\" width=607 height=260 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Collect. Evolve. Battle. Explore.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mistwilds</strong> is a multiplayer creature-collecting MMORPG where you tame wild beasts, evolve them into powerful allies, and explore a vast open world with your friends. Venture into lush grasslands, windswept peaks, and fiery deserts as you uncover rare creatures, conquer dungeons, and forge your legend.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Massive Open World</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through <strong>diverse zones</strong>: enchanted forests, sun-scorched deserts, icy peaks, magical plains, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each biome features <strong>unique wild creatures</strong>, dungeons, loot, and quests.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Real-Time PvE &amp; PvP Battles</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as your pets, you control your pets in real-time.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your team into battle against wild creatures, dungeon bosses, and other players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight in <strong>open-world arenas</strong>, challenge others in the <strong>Battlefield</strong>, or group up for <strong>epic dungeon runs</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gear up</strong> with powerful items that <strong>boost specific pet types</strong> and enhance your tactical depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789830/extras/4a82cafcd75375f7de84be6eed8abb5a.poster.avif?t=1749968532\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789830/extras/4a82cafcd75375f7de84be6eed8abb5a.webm?t=1749968532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789830/extras/4a82cafcd75375f7de84be6eed8abb5a.mp4?t=1749968532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer Exploration</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join your friends and explore together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle <strong>co-op dungeons</strong>, <strong>trade rare items and creatures</strong>, and team up to <strong>tame legendary beasts</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quests, vendors, creatures, and loot</strong> await around every corner.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789830/extras/4a25c4e1357436463638543e542136f8.poster.avif?t=1749968532\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789830/extras/4a25c4e1357436463638543e542136f8.webm?t=1749968532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789830/extras/4a25c4e1357436463638543e542136f8.mp4?t=1749968532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Character\u00a0Customization &amp; Mounts</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your adventurer with <strong>character customization</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip <strong>tons of unique gear</strong>, each with stat bonuses to help your pets and visual flair.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride <strong>evolved creature mounts</strong>\u00a0that you raised yourself.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789830/extras/7fa8aac6c88711051889359b33e75368.poster.avif?t=1749968532\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789830/extras/7fa8aac6c88711051889359b33e75368.webm?t=1749968532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789830/extras/7fa8aac6c88711051889359b33e75368.mp4?t=1749968532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect, Evolve, Master</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tame and train <strong>dozens of creature types</strong>, from fiery beasts to icy wraiths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every creature evolves through <strong>three powerful stages</strong>, each with unique visuals and abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each creature has its <strong>own unique skill set</strong>, making every companion distinct in battle and strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your dream team and <strong>strategize based on elemental types</strong> like Fire, Grass, Magic, Wind, Ground, Fighting, Holy, and Ice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the <strong>type advantage system</strong> to gain the edge in combat \u2014 just like classic creature battlers.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 150 unique pets</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 Elemental Pet Types: Fire, Ground, Grass, Magic, Wind, Fighting, Holy, Ice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Evolution Stages per Pet</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-Time Combat (PvE &amp; PvP)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamless Open World Exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Multiplayer Support (Party, Trade, Dungeons, Chat)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic Realtime Type-Based Combat System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character &amp; Gear Customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mount System with Flying &amp; Ground Variants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of Quests, Items &amp; Vendors</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're chasing rare creatures, battling your friends, or soaring above the mountains on your evolved mount \u2014 <strong>Mistwilds</strong> is your portal to an epic creature-collecting adventure with friends.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789830/extras/0471c8dad1e2908d8dab645e0db811a5.avif?t=1749968532\" width=607 height=260 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Collect. Evolve. Battle. Explore.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mistwilds</strong> is a multiplayer creature-collecting MMORPG where you tame wild beasts, evolve them into powerful allies, and explore a vast open world with your friends. Venture into lush grasslands, windswept peaks, and fiery deserts as you uncover rare creatures, conquer dungeons, and forge your legend.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Massive Open World</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through <strong>diverse zones</strong>: enchanted forests, sun-scorched deserts, icy peaks, magical plains, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each biome features <strong>unique wild creatures</strong>, dungeons, loot, and quests.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Real-Time PvE &amp; PvP Battles</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as your pets, you control your pets in real-time.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your team into battle against wild creatures, dungeon bosses, and other players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight in <strong>open-world arenas</strong>, challenge others in the <strong>Battlefield</strong>, or group up for <strong>epic dungeon runs</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gear up</strong> with powerful items that <strong>boost specific pet types</strong> and enhance your tactical depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789830/extras/4a82cafcd75375f7de84be6eed8abb5a.poster.avif?t=1749968532\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789830/extras/4a82cafcd75375f7de84be6eed8abb5a.webm?t=1749968532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789830/extras/4a82cafcd75375f7de84be6eed8abb5a.mp4?t=1749968532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer Exploration</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join your friends and explore together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle <strong>co-op dungeons</strong>, <strong>trade rare items and creatures</strong>, and team up to <strong>tame legendary beasts</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quests, vendors, creatures, and loot</strong> await around every corner.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789830/extras/4a25c4e1357436463638543e542136f8.poster.avif?t=1749968532\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789830/extras/4a25c4e1357436463638543e542136f8.webm?t=1749968532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789830/extras/4a25c4e1357436463638543e542136f8.mp4?t=1749968532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Character\u00a0Customization &amp; Mounts</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your adventurer with <strong>character customization</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip <strong>tons of unique gear</strong>, each with stat bonuses to help your pets and visual flair.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride <strong>evolved creature mounts</strong>\u00a0that you raised yourself.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789830/extras/7fa8aac6c88711051889359b33e75368.poster.avif?t=1749968532\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789830/extras/7fa8aac6c88711051889359b33e75368.webm?t=1749968532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789830/extras/7fa8aac6c88711051889359b33e75368.mp4?t=1749968532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect, Evolve, Master</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tame and train <strong>dozens of creature types</strong>, from fiery beasts to icy wraiths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every creature evolves through <strong>three powerful stages</strong>, each with unique visuals and abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each creature has its <strong>own unique skill set</strong>, making every companion distinct in battle and strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your dream team and <strong>strategize based on elemental types</strong> like Fire, Grass, Magic, Wind, Ground, Fighting, Holy, and Ice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the <strong>type advantage system</strong> to gain the edge in combat \u2014 just like classic creature battlers.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 150 unique pets</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 Elemental Pet Types: Fire, Ground, Grass, Magic, Wind, Fighting, Holy, Ice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Evolution Stages per Pet</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-Time Combat (PvE &amp; PvP)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamless Open World Exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Multiplayer Support (Party, Trade, Dungeons, Chat)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic Realtime Type-Based Combat System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character &amp; Gear Customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mount System with Flying &amp; Ground Variants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of Quests, Items &amp; Vendors</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're chasing rare creatures, battling your friends, or soaring above the mountains on your evolved mount \u2014 <strong>Mistwilds</strong> is your portal to an epic creature-collecting adventure with friends.</p>",
